      "writtenOn": "2026-07-20T19:21:55Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "It looks like this code is present in the branch, that\u0027s why it shows up as being removed here. I understand that you want to replace `(Build.IS_ENG || Build.IS_USERDEBUG)` with `mLogicalDisplayMapper.isEnabledInLayoutLocked(logicalDisplay)` so I suggest doing that only and leaving the rest unchanged, unless there\u0027s a clear reason to remove it. E.g. if the first check returns false, and `isUpdatedDisplayConnectionDialogEnabled()` also returns false, we will get the incorrect result",
      "parentUuid": "7884280c_6324c3a9",
